  "prefLabel": "Adm 800 in Document #13708 therefore replaces all prior filings for rules in the former Part Adm 610",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Adm 800 AGENCY LEASES\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #13708, effective 7-29-23, adopted, repealed, readopted, readopted with amendments, or readopted with amendments and renumbered all of the rules in Chapter Adm 600 titled “Procurement and Property Rules”. Document #13708 also adopted Chapter Adm 800 titled “Agency Leases”, which was largely based on the former Part Adm 610 titled “Agency Leases”, which Document #13708 repealed. Provisions of the former Chapter Adm 600 that were equally applicable to leasing but were not in the former Adm 610, such as those relating to the cancellation processes, were also included by Document #13708 in Chapter Adm 800, as it was the intent of the Department of Administrative Services that Chapter Adm 800 may stand independently from Chapter Adm 600.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/adm800.html"
